        "caption": "How to win over an ENFP: don't chase, attract\n\nHow do you charm an ENFP puppy?\n\nA lot of ENFPs avoid partners who stay gloomy. Look calm outside, yet stay warm and firm inside — and don't underestimate contrast: mature yet playful, or a little mysterious yet warm and loyal underneath.\n\nGentle care is great; preachy, bossy, or mistrust-driven control is not. ENFPs tend to value freedom, so they need an open mind, someone dependable, a steady anchor when they're stressed, and a good listener for their little rambles.\n\nAnd never chase too hard. Win them with attraction — never play the doormat.",
